@baseUrl = http://localhost:3005
@adminKey = put-your-admin-key-here

### Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### Apply reward from mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/rewards/apply
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "source_type": "mail",
  "source_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "reward": {
    "money_mortals": 20,
    "money_cultivators": 1
  }
}

### Retry same reward to verify idempotency
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/rewards/apply
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "source_type": "mail",
  "source_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "reward": {
    "money_mortals": 20,
    "money_cultivators": 1
  }
}
